# The 3D site (scroll3d/) is not deployed while vercel.json serves the static
# site from the repo root. Without this, /scroll3d resolves to its UNBUILT
# index.html — a page that references /src/main.tsx and can never load.
#
# To deploy the 3D site again, delete this file and set in vercel.json:
#   "buildCommand":    "cd scroll3d && npm ci && npm run build"
#   "outputDirectory": "scroll3d/dist"
scroll3d/
